ices will boost tourism in the state air taxi."]},{"id":"utet_2021_q85","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Grammar","q_hi":"The exam **went down in flames**, I should have studied well.","options_hi":["exam paper got burnt","passed with good marks","failed spectacularly","exam hall caught fire"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q85","years":"2021","q_en":"The exam **went down in flames**, I should have studied well.","options_en":["exam paper got burnt","passed with good marks","failed spectacularly","exam hall caught fire"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q86","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Grammar","q_hi":"She was determined not to **dissipate** her energies.","options_hi":["Utilize","Conserve","Manage","Organise"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q86","years":"2021","q_en":"She was determined not to **dissipate** her energies.","options_en":["Utilize","Conserve","Manage","Organise"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q87","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Grammar","q_hi":"She requested him not to **abandon** her.","options_hi":["Try","Join","Keep up","Forsake"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q87","years":"2021","q_en":"She requested him not to **abandon** her.","options_en":["Try","Join","Keep up","Forsake"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q88","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Spelling","q_hi":"Select the incorrectly spelt word from the following.","options_hi":["Potassium","Possibility","Parasology","Preamble"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q88","years":"2021","q_en":"Select the incorrectly spelt word from the following.","options_en":["Potassium","Possibility","Parasology","Preamble"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q89","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Grammar","q_hi":"Select the correct alternative which can be substituted for the sentence below.","options_hi":["Pursue","Persuit","Persuade","Peruse"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q89","years":"2021","q_en":"Select the correct alternative which can be substituted for the sentence below.","options_en":["Pursue","Persuit","Persuade","Peruse"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q90","exams":"utet1","section":"english","topic":"Grammar","q_hi":"A person who talks in sleep is called —","options_hi":["Philatelist","Somnambulist","Somniloquist","Oneirocritic"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2021 Q90","years":"2021","q_en":"A person who talks in sleep is called —","options_en":["Philatelist","Somnambulist","Somniloquist","Oneirocritic"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q91","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"समय एवं कार्य","q_hi":"किसी काम को P और Q मिलकर 12 दिनों में, Q और R मिलकर 15 दिनों में तथा R और P मिलकर 20 दिनों में समाप्त कर सकते हैं, तो P अकेले कितने दिनों में काम समाप्त करेगा?","options_hi":["10","20","30","60"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q91","years":"2021","q_en":"A work can be completed by P and Q in 12 days, Q and R in 15 days and R and P in 20 days. In how many days can P alone finish the work?","options_en":["10","20","30","60"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q92","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"औसत","q_hi":"40 विद्यार्थियों की कक्षा के औसत अंक 86 हैं। यदि 5 सर्वोत्तम अंक हटा दिये जायें, तो औसत अंक 1 कम हो जाता है। सर्वोत्तम 5 विद्यार्थियों के औसत अंक ज्ञात कीजिए —","options_hi":["92","96","93","97"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q92","years":"2021","q_en":"The average marks obtained by 40 students of a class is 86. If the 5 highest marks are removed, the average reduces by one mark. Find the average marks of the top 5 students.","options_en":["92","96","93","97"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q93","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"प्राथमिक स्तर के गणित अध्यापक के साथ मुख्य समस्या क्या है?","options_hi":["शिक्षणशास्त्रीय प्रशिक्षण का अभाव","तैयारी का अभाव","अभिलेखीकरण में व्यस्तता","इनमें से कोई नहीं"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q93","years":"2021","q_en":"What is the major problem found in a primary level teacher of mathematics?","options_en":["Lack of pedagogical training","Lack of preparation","Busyness in record maintenance","None of these"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q94","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"समय एवं कार्य","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन सी विधि \"देखो, सुनो और सीखो\" के सिद्धान्तों पर आधारित है?","options_hi":["प्रयोगशाला विधि","प्रदर्शन विधि","व्याख्यान विधि","अनुसंधान विधि"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q94","years":"2021","q_en":"Which of the following methods is based on the principles of \"Watch, listen and learn\"?","options_en":["Laboratory Method","Demonstration Method","Lecture Method","Research Method"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q95","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"यदि x + y = 2a है, तो a/(x−a) + a/(y−a) का मान है —","options_hi":["2","2a²","0","2a"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q95","years":"2021","q_en":"If x + y = 2a, then the value of a/(x−a) + a/(y−a) is —","options_en":["2","2a²","0","2a"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q96","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"एक मिश्रधातु के 400 ग्राम में जस्ता तथा ताँबा 5 : 3 के अनुपात में हैं। उस अनुपात को 5 : 6 में परिवर्तित करने के लिए कितने ग्राम ताँबा और मिलाना चाहिए?","options_hi":["50","150","550","300"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q96","years":"2021","q_en":"Zinc and Copper are in the ratio 5 : 3 in 400 gm of an alloy. How much copper (in gm) should be added to make the ratio 5 : 6?","options_en":["50","150","550","300"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q97","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"एक भिन्न के अंश तथा हर, प्रत्येक में से 1 घटाने पर भिन्न 1/3 हो जाती है। वही भिन्न, उसके अंश तथा हर, प्रत्येक में 1 जोड़ने पर 1/2 हो जाती है। उस भिन्न के अंश तथा हर का योगफल कितना है?","options_hi":["10","18","7","16"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q97","years":"2021","q_en":"If 1 is subtracted from both the numerator and the denominator of a fraction, it becomes 1/3. If 1 is added to both the numerator and denominator of that fraction, it becomes 1/2. Then the sum of the numerator and denominator of that fraction is —","options_en":["10","18","7","16"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q98","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"गति-दूरी-समय","q_hi":"एक