 तो p के स्थान पर कौन-सा अंक आएगा?","options_hi":["8","6","7","9"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q102","years":"2021","q_en":"If the number 5132416p is divisible by 3, then which digit will come in place of p?","options_en":["8","6","7","9"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q103","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"√(248 + √(52 + √(108 + √1296))) का मान होगा —","options_hi":["14","12","16","13"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q103","years":"2021","q_en":"The value of √(248 + √(52 + √(108 + √1296))) will be —","options_en":["14","12","16","13"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q104","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"संख्या 3^98 को 5 से भाग देने पर शेष रहता है —","options_hi":["1","2","3","4"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2021 Q104","years":"2021","q_en":"When the number 3^98 is divided by 5, then the remainder is —","options_en":["1","2","3","4"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q105","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"समय एवं कार्य","q_hi":"कितने घण्टों में सेकेण्डों की संख्या, 10 दिनों में मिनटों की संख्या के बराबर है?","options_hi":["2 घण्टे","3 घण्टे","4 घण्टे","5 घण्टे"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q105","years":"2021","q_en":"In how many hours is the number of seconds equal to the number of minutes in 10 days?","options_en":["2 hours","3 hours","4 hours","5 hours"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q106","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"यदि\nतो x और y के मान हैं —","options_hi":["x = 9; y = 3","x = 3; y = 9","x = 5; y = 8","x = 4; y = 8"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q106","years":"2021","q_en":"```\n9 x 7 6\n− x 6 y 9\n─────────────\n3 y y 7\n```","options_en":["x = 9; y = 3","x = 3; y = 9","x = 5; y = 8","x = 4; y = 8"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q107","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"(7 + 2√6) का वर्गमूल है —","options_hi":["√6 + 1","√3 + 2","√2 + √5","2 + √5"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q107","years":"2021","q_en":"The square root of (7 + 2√6) is —","options_en":["√6 + 1","√3 + 2","√2 + √5","2 + √5"]},{"id":