"UTET 2021 Q125","years":"2021","q_en":"After the lunch break, while teaching EVS, you find that students are not taking interest in the lesson. What would you do?","options_en":["Use audio-visual aids based on multiple intelligence to make the lesson interesting.","Change the topic immediately.","Take the children out to play in the ground.","Ask them to put their heads down on the desk and relax."]},{"id":"utet_2021_q126","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"एन.सी.ई.आर.टी. की पाठ्यपुस्तकों में पर्यावरण अध्ययन को उच्च प्राथमिकता और स्थान दिया गया है —","options_hi":["विषय की आधारभूत संकल्पनाओं की व्याख्या करने के लिए।","चिंतन और विस्मय के लिए शिक्षार्थियों को अवसर उपलब्ध कराने के लिए।","तकनीकी शब्दावली की सटीक परिभाषाएँ उपलब्ध कराने के लिए।","अधिक संख्या में अभ्यास प्रश्नों को शामिल करने के लिए।"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q126","years":"2021","q_en":"Higher priority and space has been given in NCERT textbooks on EVS to —","options_en":["Explain basic concepts of the subject.","Provide opportunities to learners for contemplation and wondering.","Provide exact definitions of technical terms.","Include a large number of practice questions."]},{"id":"utet_2021_q127","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"EVS शिक्षाशास्त्र","q_hi":"आँचल अपनी कक्षा V में पर्यावरण अध्ययन की कक्षा में अक्सर गहन जाँच-पड़ताल वाले और कल्पनापरक प्रश्न पूछती है। उसके द्वारा इस प्रकार करने का उद्देश्य ________ में सुधार करना है।","options_hi":["अवलोकन कौशलों","संवेगात्मक कौशलों","चिंतन कौशलों","बोलने सम्बन्धी कौशलों"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q127","years":"2021","q_en":"Aanchal frequently asks probing and imaginative questions in her Class V EVS. By doing so, she aims at improving —","options_en":["Observation skills","Emotional Skills","Thinking Skills","Speaking Skills"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q128","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"एक शिक्षक प्रत्येक बच्चे को अपने घरों की रद्दी सामग्री से कुछ उपयोगी वस्तु बनाने को कहता है। शिक्षक का शैक्षिक अभिप्राय **नहीं** है —","options_hi":["कक्षा के श्रेष्ठ विद्यार्थी के बारे में निर्णय करना।","बच्चों में सृजनशीलता का विकास करना।","बच्चों को पुनश्चक्रण, पुनःप्रयोग और रूपांतरण को समझाना।","कूड़े से बनी श्रेष्ठ वस्तुओं की प्रदर्शनी आयोजित करना।"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2021 Q128","years":"2021","q_en":"A teacher asks every child to use some waste material from their homes and make something useful out of it. The pedagogical intention of the teacher is **not** to —","options_en":["Judge the best student of the class.","Develop creativity among children.","Make children understand the concept of recycle, reuse and reduce.","Organize an exhibition of best articles made out of waste."]},{"id":"utet_2021_q129","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"संसार का सबसे बड़ा पारिस्थितिकी तंत्र है —","options_hi":["जंगल","घास का मैदान","झील","सागर"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2021 Q129","years":"2021","q_en":"The largest ecosystem of the world is —","options_en":["Forest","Grass Land","Lake","Ocean"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q130","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"जैव-विविधता","q_hi":"भारतवर्ष का प्रथम राष्ट्रीय उद्यान है —","options_hi":["कान्हा","पेरियार","कार्बेट","राजाजी"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2021 Q130","years":"2021","q_en":"The first National Park of India is —","options_en":["Kanha","Periyar","Corbett","Rajaji"]},{"id":"utet_2021_q131","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"गाँवों में लोग लकड़ी का उपयोग ईंधन के रूप में करते हैं, क्योंकि —","options_hi":["इसे एक आदर्श ईंधन माना जाता है।","यह आसानी से उपलब्ध है और सस्ती है।","यह पर्यावरण हितैषी है।","यह आसानी से आग पकड़ लेती है।"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2021 Q131","years":"2021","q_en":"In villages, people use wood as fuel because —","options_en":["it is considered to be an ideal fuel.","of its easy availability and low cost.","it is environment friendly.","it catches fire easily."]},{"id":"utet_2021_q132","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"कृषि एवं मृदा","q_hi":"मृ