exams":"utet1","section":"cdp","topic":"व्यक्तित्व","q_hi":"कथन-1: संवेग के विकास को परिपक्वता तथा अधिगम दोनों ही प्रभावित करते हैं। कथन-2: ये दोनों प्रक्रियाएँ एक दूसरे पर निर्भर करती हैं तथा परस्पर संबंधी हैं।","options_hi":["कथन-1 सत्य है किन्तु कथन-2 असत्य है।","केवल कथन-2 सत्य है।","दोनों कथन सत्य हैं।","दोनों कथन असत्य हैं।"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2022 Q17","years":"2022","q_en":"Statement-1: Maturation and learning both affect the development of emotions. Statement-2: Both these processes depend on each other and are mutually related.","options_en":["Statement-1 is true but statement-2 is false.","Only statement-2 is true.","Both the statements are true.","Both the statements are false."]},{"id":"utet_2022_q18","exams":"utet1","section":"cdp","topic":"मूल्यांकन","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा प्रश्न बच्चों की अवधारणात्मक समझ के परीक्षण हेतु सबसे उपयुक्त है?","options_hi":["भारत की राजधानी क्या है?","नौ ग्रहों के नाम बताइए।","रेगिस्तान में पौधों के काँटे क्यों होते हैं?","किसे राष्ट्रपिता कहा जाता है?"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2022 Q18","years":"2022","q_en":"Which of the following question will be most appropriate for testing the conceptual understanding of students?","options_en":["What is the capital of India?","Name the nine planets.","Why plants in desert have thorns?","Who is called the father of the Nation?"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q19","exams":"utet1","section":"cdp","topic":"स्मृति/सृजनात्मकता","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित में से आप किस बच्चे को सृजनात्मक कहेंगे?","options_hi":["जो नए विचार प्रस्तुत करता है।","जो नई वस्तुएँ बनाता है।","जो अपने कार्य में नवीनता और मौलिकता का प्रदर्शन करता है।","उपरोक्त सभी"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2022 Q19","years":"2022","q_en":"Out of the following, which child will you say is creative?","options_en":["Who presents new thoughts.","Who creates new things.","Who shows novelty and originality in his work.","All of the above"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q20","exams":"utet1","section":"cdp","topic":"अधिगम की प्रकृति","q_hi":"6 से 8 वय वर्ग के 