ivities is most suitable for this purpose?","options_en":["Motivate each learner to adopt and nurture a plant","Organizing debate competition","To encourage learners to participate in poster competition","Grouping of learners for group discussion"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q124","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"भारत में राष्ट्रीय आपदा प्रबन्धन संस्थान स्थित है","options_hi":["पुणे में","मिदनापुर में","नई दिल्ली में","कोलकाता में"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2022 Q124","years":"2022","q_en":"National Institute of Disaster Management in India is located at","options_en":["Pune","Midnapur","New Delhi","Kolkata"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q125","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"'इकोमार्क' सम्बन्धित है","options_hi":["निर्यात वस्तुओं से","आयात वस्तुओं से","सर्वोत्तम गुणवत्ता वाली वस्तुओं से","पर्यावरण के लिए सुरक्षित वस्तुओं से"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2022 Q125","years":"2022","q_en":"'Ecomark' is related to","options_en":["Export Commodities","Import Commodities","Commodities of best quality","Environmental Friendly commodities"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q126","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"'कार्बन क्रेडिट' की संकल्पना निम्नलिखित में से किससे उद्भूत हुई?","options_hi":["पृथ्वी सम्मेलन (रियो-डे-जेनेरो)","क्योटो प्रोटोकाल","मान्ट्रियाल प्रोटोकाल","जी-8 शिखरवार्ता"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2022 Q126","years":"2022","q_en":"The concept of 'Carbon credit' originated in which of the following?","options_en":["Earth Summit (Rio-de-Janeiro)","Kyoto protocol","Montreal protocol","G-8 Summit"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q127","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा कृत्रिम पारिस्थितिकी तंत्र है","options_hi":["धान का खेत","वन","घास का मैदान","झील"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2022 Q127","years":"2022","q_en":"Which of the following is an artificial Ecosystem","options_en":["Paddy Field","Forest","Grassland","Lake"]},{"id":"utet_2022_q128","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"कान