{"id":"utet_2024_q104","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"क्षेत्रमिति","q_hi":"एक तार को कुछ छोटे टुकड़ों में काटा गया है। प्रत्येक छोटे टुकड़े को 3 सेमी भुजा वाले वर्ग के रूप में मोड़ा गया। यदि सभी छोटे वर्गों का कुल क्षेत्रफल 108 वर्ग सेमी हो, तब तार की वास्तविक लम्बाई ज्ञात कीजिए —","options_hi":["108 सेमी","144 सेमी","136 सेमी","138 सेमी"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q104","years":"2024","q_en":"A wire is cut into several small pieces. Each of the small pieces is bent into a square of side 3 cm. If the total area of the small squares is 108 cm², then find the original length of the wire —","options_en":["108 cm","144 cm","136 cm","138 cm"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q105","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"माउण्ट एवरेस्ट 8850 मीटर की ऊँचाई पर है। इसका आधार 5400 मीटर की ऊँचाई पर है। यहाँ तापमान 1 डिग्री प्रति 100 मीटर की दर से गिरता है। यदि आधार का तापमान −5°C है, तो शीर्ष का तापमान क्या है?","options_hi":["−5°C","34.5°C","−34.5°C","−39.5°C"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q105","years":"2024","q_en":"Mt. Everest is at a height of 8850 metres. Its base is at an elevation of 5400 metres. The temperature here drops at the rate of 1 degree per 100 metres. If the temperature at the base is −5°C, what is the temperature at the top?","options_en":["−5°C","34.5°C","−34.5°C","−39.5°C"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q106","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"20 लोगों की एक पार्टी एक रेस्तरां में गई और उन्होंने प्रत्येक के लिए ₹36.60 का भोजन ऑर्डर किया, लेकिन उनमें से 5 लोग पैसे लाना भूल गए थे। बिल चुकाने के लिए बाकी 15 लोगों को और कितना अधिक भुगतान करना पड़ा?","options_hi":["₹12.20","₹15.20","₹24.40","₹20.40"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q106","years":"2024","q_en":"A party of 20 people went to a restaurant. They ordered a meal of ₹36.60 each, but 5 of them had forgotten to bring money. In order to settle the bill, how much more did the other 15 people have to pay?","options_en":["₹12.20","₹15.20","₹24.40","₹20.40"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q107","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"1948 को रोमन अंकों में लिखिए —","options_hi":["MCMXVIII","MCMXLVIII","MCMXXLVIII","MXLVIII"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q107","years":"2024","q_en":"Write 1948 in Roman Numerals —","options_en":["MCMXVIII","MCMXLVIII","MCMXXLVIII","MXLVIII"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q108","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"गणित शिक्षाशास्त्र","q_hi":"गणित के शिक्षण में मूल्यांकन किया जाना चाहिए —","options_hi":["सीखने के अनुभव प्रदान करने के समय","उद्देश्यों के स्पष्टीकरण के समय","उद्देश्यों के स्पष्टीकरण एवं सीखने के अनुभव प्रदान करने के पश्चात्","इनमें से कोई नहीं"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q108","years":"2024","q_en":"Evaluation should be done in teaching of Mathematics —","options_en":["at the time of providing experiences of learning","at the time of clarification of objectives","after the clarification of objectives and providing the experiences of learning","None of these"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q109","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"ज्यामिति","q_hi":"एक समअष्टभुज में समरूपता (सममिति) की कितनी रेखाएँ हैं?","options_hi":["0","1","2","8"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q109","years":"2024","q_en":"How many line(s) of symmetry does a regular octagon have?","options_en":["0","1","2","8"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q110","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"1⅓ ÷ 1½ ÷ 1⅑ में वह छोटी से छोटी भिन्न क्या जोड़ें, जिससे परिणाम पूर्णांक बन जाए?","options_hi":["4/5","3/5","2/5","1/5"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q110","years":"2024","q_en":"What is the least fraction that must be added to 1⅓ ÷ 1½ ÷ 1⅑ to make the result an integer?","options_en":["4/5","3/5","2/5","1/5"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q111","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"क्षेत्रमिति","q_hi":"दो वर्गों की भुजाएँ क्रमशः x सेमी तथा (2x + 1) सेमी हैं। उनके परिमापों का योगफल 100 सेमी है। उनमें से बड़े वर्ग का क्षेत्रफल (वर्ग सेमी में) है —","options_hi":["64","81","225","289"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q111","years":"2024","q_en":"Two squares have sides x cm and (2x + 1) cm respectively. The sum of their perimeters is 100 cm. Area (in cm²) of the bigger square is —","options_en":["64","81","225","289"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q112","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"दी गई श्रृंखला में बॉक्स में क्या आएगा?","options_hi":["82","81","48","62"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q112","years":"2024","q_en":"What will come in the box in the given series?\n79, 87, [ ], 89, 83, 91","options_en":["82","81","48","62"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q113","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"यदि a³ = 1 + 7, 3³ = 1 + 7 + b, 4³ = 1 + 7 + c, तब a + b + c का मान है —","options_hi":["58","75","77","110"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q113","years":"2024","q_en":"If a³ = 1 + 7, 3³ = 1 + 7 + b, 4³ = 1 + 7 + c, then the value of a + b + c is —","options_en":["58","75","77","110"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q114","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"समय एवं कार्य","q_hi":"निदान का कार्य है —","options_hi":["वर्गीकरण","सीखने की कमजोरी पहचानना","व्युत्पत्ति फलन","उपरोक्त सभी"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q114","years":"2024","q_en":"The function of diagnosis is —","options_en":["Classification","Identify learning weakness","Etymology function","All of the above"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q115","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"गणित में गणना कौशल को बढ़ाया जा सकता है —","options_hi":["केवल वैचारिक ज्ञान देकर","केवल एल्गोरिथ्म का वर्णन करके","कक्षा में हाथों की गतिविधियों को करके","बहुत सारे अभ्यासों के बाद संप्रत्ययों और प्रक्रियाओं को स्पष्ट करके"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q115","years":"2024","q_en":"Computational skills in Mathematics can be enhanced by —","options_en":["giving conceptual knowledge alone","describing algorithm only","conducting hands-on activities in class","clarifying concepts and procedures followed by lots of practice"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q116","exams":"utet1","section":"math","topic":"औसत","q_hi":"10 संख्याओं का माध्य 0 है। यदि इन संख्या