tion":"math","topic":"संख्या पद्धति","q_hi":"यदि कृषि फार्म में चावल, गेहूँ, दाल व सब्जी का कुल उत्पादन 50,000 किग्रा है, तो चावल का उत्पादन है —","options_hi":["40,000 किग्रा","2,000 किग्रा","15,000 किग्रा","20,000 किग्रा"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q120","years":"2024","q_en":"If the total production of rice, wheat, pulses and vegetables in the agricultural farm is 50,000 kg, then production of rice is —","options_en":["40,000 kg","2,000 kg","15,000 kg","20,000 kg"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q121","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"'ब्लू बेबी सिंड्रोम' जल में किस लवण की उपस्थिति के कारण होता है?","options_hi":["कार्बोनेट","नाइट्रेट","क्लोराइड","सल्फेट"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q121","years":"2024","q_en":"'Blue baby syndrome' is caused by the presence of which salt in water?","options_en":["Carbonate","Nitrate","Chloride","Sulphate"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q122","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"एग्रोस्टोलॉजी अध्ययन है —","options_hi":["पौधे का","कृषि का","शैवाल का","घास का"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q122","years":"2024","q_en":"Agrostology is the study of —","options_en":["Plants","Agriculture","Algae","Grasses"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q123","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"उत्तराखण्ड विशेष","q_hi":"\"हरियाली देवी\" पवित्र उपवन उत्तराखण्ड के निम्नलिखित में से किस जनपद में स्थित है?","options_hi":["रुद्रप्रयाग","चमोली","पौड़ी गढ़वाल","टिहरी गढ़वाल"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q123","years":"2024","q_en":"'Hariyali Devi' Sacred Grove is located in which of the following districts of Uttarakhand?","options_en":["Rudraprayag","Chamoli","Pauri Garhwal","Tehri Garhwal"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q124","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"भारत के किस राज्य में मानसून का आगमन सबसे पहले होता है?","options_hi":["पश्चिम बंगाल","असम","केरल","महाराष्ट्र"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q124","years":"2024","q_en":"In which state of India does the monsoon arrive first?","options_en":["West Bengal","Assam","Kerala","Maharashtra"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q125","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"2002 में सतत विकास पर विश्व शिखर सम्मेलन कहाँ आयोजित किया गया था?","options_hi":["जोहान्सबर्ग","जेनेवा","शंघाई","न्यूयॉर्क"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q125","years":"2024","q_en":"Where was the World Summit on Sustainable Development held in 2002?","options_en":["Johannesburg","Geneva","Shanghai","New York"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q126","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"टी.एल.एम./शिक्षण अधिगम सामग्रियाँ पर्यावरण अध्ययन के शिक्षण को सुदृढ़ करती हैं —","options_hi":["बोले गये शब्दों का पूरक बनकर","गृहकार्य आसान बनाकर","शिक्षक की गतिविधि को कम करके","उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q126","years":"2024","q_en":"TLM/Teaching learning materials reinforce the teaching of environmental studies —","options_en":["by complementing the spoken words","by making homework easier","by reducing the activity of the teacher","None of the above"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q127","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"प्रदूषण","q_hi":"ओजोन के विघटन में कौन-सा तत्व उत्प्रेरक के रूप में कार्य करता है?","options_hi":["ऑक्सीजन","क्लोरीन","फ्लोरीन","पोटैशियम"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q127","years":"2024","q_en":"Which element acts as a catalyst in the decomposition of ozone?","options_en":["Oxygen","Chlorine","Fluorine","Potassium"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q128","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"प्रयोग करना, खोज करना, जाँच करना और प्रश्न पूछना ई.वी.एस. के सक्रिय शिक्षण के आवश्यक तत्त्व हैं। एक शिक्षक \"हमें क्या खाना चाहिए\" की अवधारणा से सम्बन्धित निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सी गतिविधि आयोजित करता है?","options_hi":["ऐसे सभी खाद्य पदार्थों के चित्र ब्लैकबोर्ड पर बनाये।","विभिन्न खाद्य पदार्थों के उदाहरण दे तथा प्रत्येक खाद्य पदार्थ के आवश्यक घटकों का उल्लेख करे।","विद्यार्थियों से सभी संभावित स्रोतों से सम्बन्धित जानकारी एकत्र करने को कहे।","इस विषय पर एक वीडियो दिखाये।"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q128","years":"2024","q_en":"Experimenting, exploring, investigating and questioning constitute essential elements of active learning of EVS. A teacher arranges which one of the following activities related to the concept of 'food we should eat'?","options_en":["Draw diagrams of all such foods on the blackboard.","Give examples of different foods with essential components of each food.","Ask students to collect related information from all possible sources.","Show a video on this topic."]},{"id":"utet_2024_q129","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"वन एवं संसाधन","q_hi":"विश्व में सबसे तेजी से घटने वाला प्राकृतिक संसाधन है —","options_hi":["पानी","वन","हवा","सूरज की रोशनी"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q129","years":"2024","q_en":"The fastest depleting natural resource in the world is —","options_en":["Water","Forest","Air","Sunlight"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q130","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"जैव-विविधता","q_hi":"जैव-विविधता हॉट-स्पॉट अवधारणा निम्नलिखित में से किस वर्ष प्रस्तुत की गई थी?","options_hi":["1980","1984","1988","1994"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q130","years":"2024","q_en":"The Hot-spot concept of Biodiversity was introduced in which of the following years?","options_en":["1980","1984","1988","1994"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q131","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"विश्व प्रसिद्ध रिपोर्ट \"विकास की सीमाएँ\" (Limits to Growth), जिसमें अनियंत्रित विकास के कारण विनाश की घोषणा की गई, किसके द्वारा लिखी गई?","options_hi":["मैयर्स और सहयोगी","मीडोस और सहयोगी","ब्रुंटलैंड","विल्सन और सहयोगी"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q131","years":"2024","q_en":"The world famous report 'Limits to Growth', which declared devastation due to uncontrolled growth, was written by whom?","options_en":["Myers and associates","Meadows and associates","Brundtland","Wilson and associates"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q132","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"वन एवं संसाधन","q_hi":"किस राज्य ने संयुक्त वन प्रबंधन के लिए पहला प्रस्ताव पारित किया?","options_hi":["मध्य प्रदेश","कर्नाटक","हिमाचल प्रदेश","उड़ीसा"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q132","years":"2024","q_en":"Which state passed the first resolution for joint forest management?","options_en":["Madhya Pradesh","Karnataka","Himachal Pradesh","Odisha"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q133","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"वन एवं संसाधन","q_hi":"चन्दन वन किस तरह के वन के उदाहरण हैं?","options_hi":["डेल्टाई वन","कांटेदार वन","सदाबहार वन / मैंग्रोव वन","पर्णपाती वन"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q133","years":"2024","q_en":"Sandalwood forests are examples of which type of forest?","options_en":["Deltaic forest","Thorny forest","Mangrove forest","Deciduous forest"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q134","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"तेल-रिसाव के बारे में निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा कथन सत्य है?\n(1) तेल रिसाव से जैविक ऑक्सीजन की माँग बढ़ जाती है।\n(2) तेल रिसाव से समुद्री जल में ऑक्सीजन की मात्रा कम हो जाती है।","options_hi":["केवल (1)","केवल (2)","(1) और (2) दोनों","उपरोक्त में से कोई नहीं"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q134","years":"2024","q_en":"Which of the following is true about oil spills?\n(1) Oil spills increase the biological oxygen demand.\n(2) Oil spills reduce the oxygen in the sea water.","options_en":["Only (1)","Only (2)","Both (1) and (2)","None of the above"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q135","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"उत्तराखण्ड विशेष","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित सामाजिक-पारिस्थितिक आंदोलनों को सही कालानुक्रमिक क्रम में व्यवस्थित करें —\n(i) आरे आंदोलन, मुम्बई (ii) चिपको आंदोलन (iii) नर्मदा बचाओ आंदोलन (iv) जंगल बचाओ आंदोलन","options_hi":["i, ii, iii, iv","ii, iv, iii, i","ii, iii, iv, i","iii, iv, ii, i"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q135","years":"2024","q_en":"Arrange the following social-ecological movements in correct chronological order —\n(i) Aarey Movement, Mumbai (ii) Chipko Movement (iii) Narmada Bachao Movement (iv) Jungle Bachao Movement","options_en":["i, ii, iii, iv","ii, iv, iii, i","ii, iii, iv, i","iii, iv, ii, i"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q136","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"गोबर के अतिरिक्त वह अपतृण (खरपतवार) जो बायो-गैस उत्पादन में प्रयुक्त हो सकती है —","options_hi":["हाइड्रिला","मकोय (सोलेनम नाइग्रम)","जलकुम्भी","गाजर घास"],"ans":2,"source":"UTET 2024 Q136","years":"2024","q_en":"Apart from cow dung, the weed that can be used in biogas production is —","options_en":["Hydrilla","Makoi (Solanum nigrum)","Eichhornia","Parthenium"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q137","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"'ग्रेट हिमालयन नेशनल पार्क' किस राज्य में स्थित है?","options_hi":["उत्तराखण्ड","जम्मू और कश्मीर","सिक्किम","हिमाचल प्रदेश"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q137","years":"2024","q_en":"'Great Himalayan National Park' is located in which of the following states?","options_en":["Uttarakhand","Jammu and Kashmir","Sikkim","Himachal Pradesh"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q138","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"भूगोल एवं नदियाँ","q_hi":"गंगा ऐक्शन प्लान किस प्रधानमंत्री के कार्यकाल में शुरू किया गया था?","options_hi":["मोरारजी देसाई","राजीव गांधी","अटल बिहारी वाजपेयी","पी.वी. नरसिम्हा राव"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q138","years":"2024","q_en":"Ganga Action Plan was started during the tenure of which Prime Minister?","options_en":["Morarji Desai","Rajiv Gandhi","Atal Bihari Vajpayee","P. V. Narasimha Rao"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q139","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"कवितायें एवं कहानियाँ पर्यावरण अध्ययन के विषय को प्रभावी ढंग से प्रस्तुत करती हैं। ऐसा इसलिए है, क्योंकि कवितायें और कहानियाँ —\n(i) प्रासंगिक शिक्षण वातावरण प्रदान कर सकती हैं।\n(ii) रचनात्मकता और सौन्दर्यबोध को पोषित कर सकती हैं।\n(iii) बच्चे के परिवेश का समृद्ध चित्रण कर सकती हैं।\n(iv) विभिन्न अवधारणाओं को समझा सकती हैं।","options_hi":["केवल (i), (ii) एवं (iii)","केवल (iv)","केवल (iii) एवं (iv)","केवल (i)"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q139","years":"2024","q_en":"Poems and stories are effective in transacting the theme of EVS. This is because poems and stories —\n(i) can provide the contextual learning environment.\n(ii) can nurture creativity and aesthetic sense.\n(iii) can be rich depictions of the child's environment.\n(iv) can explain various concepts.","options_en":["Only (i), (ii) and (iii)","Only (iv)","Only (iii) and (iv)","Only (i)"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q140","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"कृषि एवं मृदा","q_hi":"सिंचाई प्रणाली में उर्वरकों, मृदा सुधारकों और अन्य जल में घुलनशील उत्पादों को डालने के लिए शब्द प्रयोग किया जाता है —","options_hi":["उर्वरक","फर्टिगेशन","ड्रिप सिंचाई","पर्णीपोषण (पत्तियों पर खाद डालना)"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q140","years":"2024","q_en":"The term used for the application of fertilizers, soil improvers and other water-soluble products into an irrigation system is —","options_en":["Fertilizer","Fertigation","Drip irrigation","Foliar feeding"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q141","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा सजीव और निर्जीव घटक के बीच परस्पर क्रिया का उदाहरण है?","options_hi":["खाद्य श्रृंखला","खाद्य जाल","शिकार करना","जल चक्र"],"ans":3,"source":"UTET 2024 Q141","years":"2024","q_en":"Which of the following is an example of interaction between living and nonliving components?","options_en":["Food chain","Food web","Hunting","Water cycle"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q142","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"भूगोल एवं नदियाँ","q_hi":"काई (शैवाल) की अत्यधिक वृद्धि व पोषक तत्वों से समृद्ध झील को कहते हैं —","options_hi":["यूट्रोफिक","ओलिगोट्रोफिक","डायस्ट्रोफिक","मिरोमिक्टिक"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q142","years":"2024","q_en":"The lake having excessive growth of algae and richness in nutrients is called —","options_en":["Eutrophic","Oligotrophic","Dystrophic","Meromictic"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q143","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"प्रदूषण","q_hi":"भारत सरकार ने जल (प्रदूषण निवारण एवं नियंत्रण) अधिनियम पारित किया —","options_hi":["1999 में","1974 में","1996 में","1975 में"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q143","years":"2024","q_en":"The Government of India passed the Water (Prevention and Control of Pollution) Act in —","options_en":["1999","1974","1996","1975"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q144","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"पारिस्थितिकी","q_hi":"समुदाय के बारे में निम्नलिखित में से कौन-से कथन सही हैं?\n(1) समुदाय स्थिर या कठोर होता है।\n(2) समुदाय बड़े या छोटे हो सकते हैं।\n(3) अधिकांश मामलों में समुदायों का नाम प्रमुख पौधों की प्रजातियों के नाम पर रखा जाता है।","options_hi":["केवल (1) और (2)","केवल (2) और (3)","केवल (1) और (3)","(1), (2) और (3)"],"ans":1,"source":"UTET 2024 Q144","years":"2024","q_en":"Which of the following statements are correct regarding community?\n(1) A community is fixed or rigid.\n(2) Communities may be large or small.\n(3) Communities in most instances are named after the dominant plant species.","options_en":["Only (1) and (2)","Only (2) and (3)","Only (1) and (3)","(1), (2) and (3)"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q145","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"प्रदूषण","q_hi":"वायु (प्रदूषण निवारण एवं नियंत्रण) अधिनियम, 1981 के किस अनुच्छेद (धारा) के तहत राज्य बोर्ड किसी भी क्षेत्र को 'वायु प्रदूषण नियन्त्रण क्षेत्र' घोषित कर सकता है?","options_hi":["धारा 19","धारा 20","धारा 21","धारा 22"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q145","years":"2024","q_en":"Under which Section of the Air (Prevention and Control of Pollution) Act, 1981, can the state board declare any area as an 'Air Pollution Control Area'?","options_en":["Section 19","Section 20","Section 21","Section 22"]},{"id":"utet_2024_q146","exams":"utet1","section":"evs","topic":"जीव अनुकूलन","q_hi":"यदि हम पक्षियों का अवलोकन करें तो पायेंगे कि अधिकांश पक्षी अक्सर अपनी गर्दन हिलाते रहते हैं। ऐसा इसलिए होता है, क्योंकि —","options_hi":["अधिकांश पक्षियों की आँखें स्थिर होती हैं और हिल नहीं सकतीं।","उनके कान ढके होते हैं और वे उड़ सकते हैं।","पक्षियों की दो आँखें होती हैं।","उनकी आँखें एक समय में दो अलग-अलग वस्तुओं पर ध्यान केन्द्रित कर सकती हैं।"],"ans":0,"source":"UTET 2024 Q146","years":"2024","q_en":"If we observe birds, we find that most of the birds often move t